<h2 class="bde-heading-506-117 bde-heading">
What Does Ja Morant’s Contract With the Trail Blazers Include?
</h2><div class="bde-fancy-container-506-118 bde-fancy-container">
  
  
	



<div class="bde-fancy-container-506-141 bde-fancy-container">
  
  
	



<div class="bde-f-text-506-154 bde-f-text">
<p>Morant signed a five-year extension worth <strong>$197.23m</strong> with <a href="/teams/memphis-grizzlies/">Memphis</a> in 2022 under the designated rookie rules, all of it guaranteed, with a 15% trade bonus. Portland took it on when it traded for him.</p>
<p>The deal was written to pay <strong>$192.2m</strong> without an All-NBA selection and <strong>$231.4m</strong> with one. He reaches free agency in 2028 at 28.</p>

